        "Sources": {
          "QiAwakening": "Qi-Drawing Talisman: craft at a Work Bench with 3 Low-Grade Spirit Stones and 2 Spirit Gel. Gather materials from spirit-vein enemies.",
          "QiCondensation": "Qi-Condensing Pill: craft at an Earth Clay Furnace with 3 Greenwood Roots and 5 Low-Grade Spirit Stones. The mouse cursor must be empty when crafting. Gather roots in the Greenwood Herb Garden.",
          "Foundation": "Foundation Pill: craft at an Alchemy Cauldron with 4 Greenwood Roots, 4 Furnace Slag Iron and 10 Low-Grade Spirit Stones. The mouse cursor must be empty when crafting. Slag comes from the Sunken Furnace Vein.",
          "GoldenCore": "Star Eclipse Crystal: defeat the Abyssal Star Womb; in Expert/Master, open its treasure bag.",
          "NascentSoul": "Old Heaven Dao Scroll: supplied by the Archive Scroll Spirit shop and sword-soul commission, subject to their requirements. This is a breakthrough item, not a firing magic weapon.",
          "SpiritSevering": "Heaven Dao Fragment: defeat the Heaven Tablet Guardian or Broken Heaven Inspector; in Expert/Master, open their treasure bags.",
          "Tribulation": "Moonbone: defeat the Moonbone Immortal; in Expert/Master, open its treasure bag.",
          "DaoSevering": "Dao Severing Dust: defeat the Moonbone Immortal or Old Heaven Dao Core; in Expert/Master, open their treasure bags."
        },
